    },
    {
      "text": "CTCAC CA-25-426: Berryessa Family Apartments, located at 1655 Berryessa Road in San Jose on a 2.35 acre site, requested and is being recommended for a reservation of $7,126,766 in annual federal tax credits and $69,000,000 of tax-exempt bond cap to finance the new construction of 260 units of housing, consisting of 257 restricted rental units and 3 unrestricted manager's units. Recorded as a note because this funding covers Berryessa Family Apartments (260 units), which may be one component of this record.",
